# 行尾统一：源码在库里一律 LF，检出时按平台
# 本机 core.autocrlf 未设置，没有这条的话，未来在 Linux 上提交会把整仓库标成已修改
* text=auto

*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.pro text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换、不按文本 diff（PNG 被当文本处理会永久损坏）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.so binary
*.apk binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
